KOTOR Academy is an unofficial, free, non-commercial fan project. It plays
Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic and Knights of the Old Republic II -
The Sith Lords with the real-time movement and lightsaber combat of Star
Wars Jedi Knight: Jedi Academy.

What KOTOR Academy is built on
------------------------------
KOTOR Academy is a modified version of kjk, the open-source engine that
plays the KOTOR games with Jedi Academy's combat.

  kjk   https://github.com/kjk-engine/kjk
  Copyright (c) 2026 the kjk contributors, MIT License

KOTOR Academy's own work on top of kjk includes its combat presentation and
balance, saber styles and guards drawn from Movie Duels, companion and
scene fixes for both campaigns, Manaan's underwater play, the practice
arena, save handling, the player launcher and its documentation.

Game data
---------
KOTOR Academy contains no data from any game and no files from any mod. It
reads Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic, Star Wars: Knights of the Old
Republic II - The Sith Lords, Star Wars Jedi Knight: Jedi Academy and the
Movie Duels mod from installs the player already owns. Nothing from those
games or mods is shipped in this repository or in any release.

